# Code Review Graph

This repo has a Tree-sitter knowledge graph via the `user-code-review-graph` MCP.

Always start with `get_minimal_context_tool` (`task` = the current job, `detail_level` = `minimal`). Prefer graph tools over Grep/Glob/Read until the graph cannot answer.

- Explore: `semantic_search_nodes_tool`, `query_graph_tool` (`callers_of`, `callees_of`, `imports_of`, `tests_for`, `children_of`)
- Architecture: `get_architecture_overview_tool`, `list_communities_tool`
- Review/impact: `detect_changes_tool`, `get_impact_radius_tool`, `get_affected_flows_tool`
- After edits: `build_or_update_graph_tool` (incremental). Use `full_rebuild=true` only when the graph looks stale.

Repo root: the workspace root (`sole_ecommerce`). Ignore `fe/node_modules`, `be/build`, and `.code-review-graph/`.
